Alembic migrations for the Al Dente backend.

DB URL is taken from app.config.settings.database_url (which reads .env via
pydantic-settings). alembic.ini's sqlalchemy.url is intentionally blank.

Common commands (run from backend/):
  uv run alembic upgrade head        # apply all pending migrations
  uv run alembic current             # show currently applied revision
  uv run alembic history             # list known revisions
  uv run alembic revision -m "msg"   # create new migration file

The 0001 baseline is hand-authored (not autogenerated) because PG ENUM type
creation is fiddly under autogenerate.
